# Tessera issue mirror — a local copy of the JMF project's issues, written by the `tessera` skill
# so a future session can read the tickets with no server running. It is not source, it goes stale
# the moment somebody edits an issue elsewhere, and a merge conflict in it would be meaningless.
/.tessera/

# Mirrors of WiQi pages — the record is WiQi, these are copies for reading with the server down.
/.wiqi/

# Kiwi page mirror — a local copy of the pages this codebase writes, by the `kiwi` skill
# Kiwi is the record; these are copies. Never committed.
/.kiwi/
